n `App.tsx` and passing them down as props. I am verifying what song states currently exist in `App.tsx`. I\'ll also modify other views like `LibraryView` and `PlaylistDetailView` to utilize the new states. The goal is real-time updates everywhere. I\'ll persist the songs array to `localStorage` when loaded.\n\n\n"
