    modified_response: "I will modify `src/components/HomeView.tsx` to:\n1. Accept the dynamic list of `songs` as a prop so that newly uploaded tracks are shown in recommendations.\n2. Replace hardcoded `text-white` classes with adaptive `text-obsidian-on-surface` classes so that all titles, playlist banners, and bento grids are fully rendered in dark text during light mode and light text during dark mode.\n3. Handle the scenario if playlists are empty (since the user asked to \"Remove all initial playlists\"). When no playlists are created yet, it will display a gorgeous empty state guiding users to create their first public playlist in 1 click! This makes the blank state extremely polished and useful."
