aylists and `selectedPlaylist`. The goal is instant UI feedback when removing songs. This ensures seamless synchronization of state across the app. Also, I\'ve added handling for the `handleUploadAddSong` function, and added the requisite imports. I have also added `const [isAddSongModalOpen, setIsAddSongModalOpen] = useState(false);`\n\n\n"
